@* No IsLoading parameter, and none is needed: Unpoly marks whatever started a
   request with .up-active, and the library grows the spinner from that. [up-disable] makes the
   form inert while it is out. Nothing here knows whether a request is in flight — the browser
   does. *@
<form method="post" up-target=".doc-main">
    <Button up-disable>Save changes</Button>
</form>
